    "p01.pdf": {
      "1": "Equipment inventory\nSpare labels are stored beside the front desk.\n\n\f",
      "2": "Emergency cooling procedure\nSwitch off the pump before removing a blocked filter.\nWear gloves and allow the housing to cool.\nMaintenance code CLG-57260.\n\n\f"
    },
    "p02.pdf": {
      "1": "Visitor guide\nThe gallery opens at ten in the morning.\n\n\f",
      "2": "Museum access\nVisitors using wheelchairs can enter through the south ramp.\nAn elevator beside the ticket desk reaches every exhibition floor.\n\n\f"
    },
    "p03.pdf": {
      "1": "Library membership\nIdentification is needed for a new borrowing card.\n\n\f",
      "2": "Borrowing policy\nLoans can be extended online before the due date.\nAn item requested by another reader cannot be renewed.\n\n\f"
    },
    "p04.pdf": {
      "1": "Travel notes\nTickets are sold at the station kiosk.\n\n\f",
      "2": "Luggage storage\nTravelers can leave bags in staffed lockers near platform three.\nCollect luggage before the counter closes at eight in the evening.\n\n\f"
    }
  },
